{"id":"inicio.primer-problema.bus-excursion","lesson":"inicio.primer-problema","kind":"encontrar-error","level":"brote","required":true,"title":[{"type":"text","text":"The school trip bus"}],"statement":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"95 pupils are going on a trip in buses with 40 seats. A classmate wrote this program and says 2 buses are needed. Is that right? If not, fix it."}]}],"restriction":[],"hints":[[{"type":"text","text":"Do a worked example: how many pupils fit in 2 buses?"}],[{"type":"code","tokens":[["div","operator"]]},{"type":"text","text":" is another way of dividing. Find out what it does with what is left over in "},{"type":"spec_link","section":"expresiones.division","text":"the Specification"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],[{"type":"text","text":"Compare with the last line of the party: there were people left over there too."}],[{"type":"text","text":"The fixed line is "},{"type":"code","tokens":[["Write","keywordStructured"],[" "],["\"Buses: \"","literalString"],[",","punctuation"],[" "],["ceil","identifier"],["(","punctuation"],["95","literalNumber"],[" "],["/","operator"],[" "],["40","literalNumber"],[")","punctuation"],[";","punctuation"]]},{"type":"text","text":", which shows 3. Close with the variant."}]],"variant":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"How many more pupils could go without ordering a fourth bus? (Answer: 25, because 3 buses carry 120.)"}]}],"explanation":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"The classmate's program drops the 15 pupils who do not fill a bus. The fix uses "},{"type":"code","tokens":[["ceil","identifier"]]},{"type":"text","text":". Frequent mistake: adding 1 by hand, which works with 95 and fails with 80."}]}],"program":{"id":"inicial","title":"","source":"Algorithm Buses\n  Write \"Buses: \", 95 Div 40;\nEndAlgorithm\n","lines":[[["Algorithm","keywordStructured"],[" "],["Buses","identifier"]],[["  "],["Write","keywordStructured"],[" "],["\"Buses: \"","literalString